              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>Free plan</td>
                <td class="col-nimbus winner"><span class="check">✓</span> 1 site · unlimited media · no time limit</td>
                <td class="col-them"><span class="dash">—</span> Paid only</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>License model</td>
                <td class="col-nimbus winner">Per site · no media cap</td>
